	(text "ICM-42670-P at 0x68 (AP_AD0 low), I2C (AP_CS to VDDIO), FSYNC to GND, RESV pins open (DS-000451 table 9). INT1 (GPIO4, RTC) ="
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 81.28 0)
		(effects
